  "goodToKnow": "Begnadigen means to pardon: einen Verurteilten begnadigen. In Germany, the Bundespräsident holds the right of pardon (das Gnadenrecht) for federal cases, and state premiers for most others; it's used rarely. The Begnadigung of former RAF terrorists in the 2000s was hotly debated. Die Gnade means mercy. Not separable: begnadigte, hat begnadigt."
